            ("FIP: history of padel", "https://www.padelfip.com/history/"),
            ("Padel Addict: how to write the word pádel (RAE entry)", "https://www.padeladdict.com/como-se-escribe-la-palabra-padel/"),
            ("Courel-Ibáñez and Sánchez-Alcaraz (2018), ¿Pádel, paddle o paddle-tennis?, Lecturas: Educación Física y Deportes", "https://efdeportes.com/efdeportes/index.php/EFDeportes/article/view/240"),
            ("Wikipedia: paddle tennis", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paddle_tennis"),
            ("POP Tennis (International POP Tennis Association)", "https://poptennis.com/"),
